{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"889","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"碳排放統計 工業、服務業減最多","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">工商時報 馮建棨<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span>&nbsp;</span>2020.07.22</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.ctspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E7%A2%B3%E6%8E%92%E6%94%BE%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%B6.jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 80%;\\\" />&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">今年排碳大戶仍是工業，占整體<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">48.9</span>％，其次是能源與運輸，分別占<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">14.5</span>％及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">14.0</span>％。圖<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">/</span>本報資料照片</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">經濟部能源局<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">21</span>日公布最新能源類別碳排放統計指出，因能源消費去年比前年減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">0.6</span>％，主要是工業及服務類減少最多，分別年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4.42</span>％及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4.56</span>％，僅有運輸部門年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">0.59</span>％。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">能源局表示，工業部門排放減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">585</span>萬公噸，年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4.4</span>％，主要是各產業生產指數多呈下降趨勢，以致整體能源消費減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.1</span>％，其中非電力能源消費減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3.4</span>％，電力消費則減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1.0</span>％，加上電力排碳係數下降所致，工業部門排放呈減少趨勢。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">官員說，政府持續推動增氣減煤，讓生煤使用量持續下降，其中電力排碳係數下降<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4.5</span>％。另外去年年燃料燃燒二氧化碳排放量為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.58</span>億公噸，比前年的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.67</span>億公噸減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3.2</span>％，唯有運輸部門較去年增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">0.6</span>％，整體排放量都呈現減少趨勢。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">值得注意的是，今年排碳大戶仍是工業，占整體<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">48.9</span>％，其次是能源與運輸，分別占<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">14.5</span>％及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">14.0</span>％，另外住宅部門碳排占整體<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">11.0</span>％，服務業部門<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10.4</span>％，農業部門排放量占比最小，僅占<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1.2</span>％</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">能源局強調，去年燃料燃燒二氧化碳排放量已較前年減少，顯示我國溫室氣體排放已朝<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2020</span>年淨排放較<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2005</span>年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>％的第一期階段管制目標邁進，未來透過持續推動部門減碳與能源轉型，達成減碳目標。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">: https://ctee.com.tw/news/policy/304835.html</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-07-24","clk_count":"99"}},"__N_SSG":true}